.TH PR-DIGEST 1 "2026-07-27" "pr-digest" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pr-digest \- print a GitHub pull-request discussion digest
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pr-digest
.I owner/repository pull-request-number
.br
.B pr-digest
.I pull-request-url
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pr-digest
uses the GitHub CLI to fetch review comments and general comments for a pull request.
It prints both line-level review comments and issue-level discussion comments in a readable digest.
.PP
The GitHub CLI must be authenticated for private repositories and for any operation requiring authentication.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I owner/repository
GitHub repository, for example
.B anthropics/claude-code .
.TP
.I pull-request-number
Numeric pull-request number.
.TP
.I pull-request-url
A GitHub pull-request URL from which the repository and number are extracted.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
pr-digest anthropics/claude-code 123
pr-digest https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/pull/123
.fi
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.BR gh (1)
with access to the target repository.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The digest was produced. Empty comment sections are reported as such.
.TP
.B 1
The arguments could not be parsed or the GitHub request failed.
